    "title": "Kentucky man wanted for rape arrested in Bay County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WJHG Newsroom ,\n6 hours ago PANAMA CITY BEACH, Fla. (WJHG/WECP) - On Wednesday afternoon, the Bay County Sheriff’s Office arrested a Kentucky rape suspect at a construction site on Panama City Beach. BCSO, along with the Escambia County Sheriff’s Office, learned that the suspect, Shane White, was working construction along Back Beach Road and was believed to be armed. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 12",
